# Build context hygiene — sources go in, artifacts and junk stay out.
# dist/ is rebuilt inside the image so stale host builds can't leak in.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
# The desktop shell's build artifacts (MX3/MX4). The server tree's native
# modules are built for Electron's ABI, and `release/` is a whole Electron
# runtime plus a DMG and an NSIS installer — gigabytes, none of it an input to
# a server image. Docker ignore patterns are exact path matches, so the
# staging siblings (`server-runtime.pglite-stage/`, `server-runtime.stamp.json`)
# need their own line; eslint, prettier and apps/desktop/.gitignore already
# treat all of these as derived.
apps/desktop/server-runtime
apps/desktop/server-runtime.*
apps/desktop/release
**/.turbo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
design
prototype
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
